---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Clinical Standards & Practice Framework"
  description="Explore the professional standards, ethics, confidentiality, and individualized clinical framework upheld at Nepal Hypnosis Kathmandu."
>

  <!-- HERO SECTION -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-[#FAF8F5] pt-12 pb-14 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl text-center mx-auto">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">
        ETHICAL PRACTICE & GOVERNANCE
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-[Poppins] text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">
        Clinical Standards & Approach
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        At Nepal Hypnosis, our practice is grounded in professional ethics, evidence-informed care, absolute confidentiality, and deep respect for each client's individuality.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTENT SECTION -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl space-y-12 text-[#475569]">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-3">1. Our Approach to Care</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          We reject rigid, one-size-fits-all models. Every individual brings a unique history, relational background, and internal strength. Our eclectic and integrative psychotherapy framework tailors interventions specifically to what is clinically appropriate and meaningful for you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-3">2. Initial Assessment & Treatment Planning</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Care begins with a structured initial consultation and assessment. We explore your current difficulties, relevant life history, and personal goals. Together, we establish collaborative treatment milestones rather than imposing pre-determined timelines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-3">3. Confidentiality & Privacy</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Confidentiality is the cornerstone of trust in psychotherapy. All disclosures, clinical session records, and communications are protected under stringent professional ethics. The boundaries of confidentiality—such as immediate risk to self or others—are transparently discussed during your first session.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-3">4. Evidence-Informed Practice & Supervision</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Our lead practitioners maintain active advanced academic candidacy (such as PsyD studies) and engage in continuous professional development and peer supervision. We draw upon validated psychotherapeutic modalities while maintaining rigorous boundaries regarding what alternative or adjunctive techniques can and cannot achieve.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <div class="bg-[#FAF8F5] p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2e8f0]">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] mb-3">5. Emergency & Crisis Limitations</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Nepal Hypnosis operates as an outpatient psychotherapy and counselling clinic. We are not an emergency crisis-response facility. For acute psychiatric emergencies, clients are directed immediately to hospital emergency services or national crisis helplines (such as 1166).
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl">Questions about how we work?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-blue-100 text-base leading-relaxed">
        We invite you to reach out through our secure portal to discuss how our clinical approach can support your well-being.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">
          Request a Confidential Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>